  "description": "[I cannot forgive you for using me, the God of Astrology, to deceive people.]  \nIf fraud is a skill, then Yoo Seolyeon who has a fraud skill score of 99, uses 100% of her talent to run a fortune telling shop.\n\n\"Please save us, Goddess Diana!\"\n\nWho am I? Where am I? Before I could even think, lots of people came in and the room falls into chaos…\n\nYoo Seolyeon, a fraudulent fortune teller possessed the body of the Goddess Diana.\n\nWill her morale work on this world as well?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64606191), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%8B%A0%EB%85%80%EB%A5%BC-%EB%AF%BF%EC%A7%80-%EB%A7%88%EC%84%B8%EC%9A%94/4183)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/177064)",
